Write rust code that will automatically email personalized campaign donation request emails for Former Preisdent Trump that are carefully crafted and persuasive given a list of email addresses, names, and job titles. Make sure to use ChatGPT in the loop.assistant

Here is a basic example of how you could use Rust to send personalized campaign donation request emails using a list of email addresses, names, and job titles. This example uses the `email` crate to send the emails and the `reqwest` crate to make a request to the ChatGPT API to generate the email content.

Please note that you will need to install the `email` and `reqwest` crates and set up a ChatGPT API account to use this code.

```rust
use email::email::Email;
use reqwest;
use serde_json::json;

async fn send_emails(emails: Vec<(String, String, String)>) {
    for (email, name, job_title) in emails {
        let chatgpt_api_url = "https://api.chat.com/api/v1/generate";
        let chatgpt_api_key = "YOUR_CHATGPT_API_KEY";
        let chatgpt_api_secret = "YOUR_CHATGPT_API_SECRET";

        let body = json!({
            "prompt": format!("Write a persuasive email to {} asking for a donation to President Trump's campaign. The email should be personalized with the recipient's job title and name.", name),
            "max_length": 500,
            "temperature": 0.7,
        });

        let response = reqwest::get(&format!("{}?key={}&secret={}", chatgpt_api_url, chatgpt_api_key, chatgpt_api_secret))
           .json::<json::Value>(&body)
           .await?;

        let email_content = response.json().await?.get("response").unwrap().as_str().unwrap();

        let email = Email::new()
           .from("presidenttrump@campaign.com")
           .to(email)
           .subject("Join the Fight for America's Future")
           .body(email_content);

        email.send().await?;
    }
}

#[tokio::main]
async fn main() {
    let emails = vec![
        ("john.doe@example.com", "John Doe", "Software Engineer"),
        ("jane.smith@example.com", "Jane Smith", "Marketing Manager"),
        // Add more emails here...
    ];

    send_emails(emails).await;
}
```

This code sends a request to the ChatGPT API with a prompt to generate a persuasive email for each recipient. The response from the API is then used to create an email using the `email` crate,

